NAMING / NON-AFFILIATION

SkillGuard is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or an official implementation
of any academic or third-party project that shares this name. In particular:

  * "SkillGuard: A Permission Framework for Agent Skills"
    (arXiv:2606.03024) is an academic work proposing a runtime permission
    framework for agent skills. This project implements an independent,
    pre-install, fully static subset of the permission-manifest idea and
    contains no code from that work.
  * "Skill Drift Is Contract Violation: Proactive Maintenance for LLM Agent
    Skill Libraries" (arXiv:2605.10990) is a separate research system.

